OtaNix ry and #link("https://monad.fi/en")[Monad] organized the first Nix meetup in Finland outside Helsinki.

The meetup featured food, drinks and snacks alongside the following presentations:
+ #link("https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2604.11398")[Nix: a solution with problems] by Matias
+ Project showcase, #link("https://github.com/braiins/llm-jail")[llm-jail] by Luukas
+ #link("https://someonex.net/scratch/helnix-tampere/")[Nixpkgs CUDA: Status] by `@SomeoneSerge`
+ #link("https://github.com/OtaNix-ry/workshop/blob/main/2026-05-28/wrapper-configurations.typ")[Configuration with wrappers] by Roy

